# ABB M2M/DMTME.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | ABB M2M/DMTME — Modbus register map for Omni Console
# | 
# | Source: abb-m2m-dmtme-modbus.pdf (Technical specification V2.0, 2CSG445011D0201)
# | - Covers: M2M MODBUS, M2M ALARM, M2M I/O, DMTME-I-485.
# | - 3-phase energy and power quality meter, RS485 Modbus RTU.
# | - Holding registers FC03 only.
# | - All values are 2-word (Unsigned Long = u32 / Signed Long = s32); Big-Endian.
# | - Addresses are raw protocol hex addresses (0x1000 = 4096 decimal).
# | - (s) registers: Signed in M2M, Unsigned in DMTME — mapped as s32 for M2M compatibility.
# | - Superscript II = M2M instruments only; III = M2M I/O model only; IV = THD registers.
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, baud=4800–19200 (M2M) / 2400–19200 (DMTME), 8N1/E1/O1.
@mbmap=1
@vendor=ABB
@model=M2M/DMTME
@vendor_website=abb.com
@description=3-phase energy and power quality meter — phase/line V/I, P/Q/S/PF, CosPhi, frequency, energy (Wh/VArh*100), THD, max values, 15-min averages (FC03, Big-Endian, 0x1000 int32 bank).
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/abb-m2m-dmtme.toml; Source: abb-m2m-dmtme-modbus.pdf (Technical specification V2.0, 2CSG445011D0201). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
@x_status=unverified
@x_origin=omniconsole

